/* ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   pdf/poppins-fonts.js
   Poppins (subset: Latin + common punctuation) as base64 TTF for jsPDF.
   Each weight is subsetted to ~14.5 KB so the report renders in the brand
   typeface without bloating the bundle. download.js imports this LAZILY
   inside downloadPDF() and registers it over the 'helvetica' family, so a
   missing file falls back to Helvetica rather than breaking the app.
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
